          "title": "Terence Tao and Gang Tian, A singularity removal theorem for Yang\u2013Mills fields in higher dimensions, Lemma 4.7 and subsequent regularity discussion, pp.17\u201319",
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/math/0209352"
        }
